+### Proposed: intent changes are proposed by contributors and decided by Justin
+
+**Status**: Proposed 2026-10-07 by an entropy-assessment agent run. Awaiting Justin's decision; not in force.
+**Context**: `INTENT.md`'s header and `AGENTS.md` ("Consult INTENT.md for significant decisions") let any contributor, agents included, revise `INTENT.md` with a dated note. The last revision (2026-04-07) records no author, so a reader cannot tell an approved change of intent from drift.
+**Proposal**: A contributor whose work would change the intent records the change here, marked Proposed. `INTENT.md` changes only after Justin's recorded decision, and its revision note cites that decision. `INTENT.md`'s header and the `AGENTS.md` practice would be reworded to match once decided.
+**Alternative**: Keep the current rule: any contributor revises `INTENT.md` directly, with a dated note.
+
